2. ★ r_s 鏈 (冇 420/421 修正)
==========================================================================
  r_s = πR/88 = 147.43857 Mpc (IDCM 聲學視界 = 半同步波長)
  vs Planck r_s = 147.09: dev 0.237%
  vs Planck r_s = 147.05 (Planck 2018 best): dev 0.264%

  r_s/λ_sync = 1/2 (定義)
  λ_sync = πR/44 → R = 44λ_sync/π
  → R_world = 44 × λ_sync / π
  → R_world = 44 × (2r_s) / π = 88r_s/π

